ale Original | Verified: SSC CGL Statistics — Measures of Relative Dispersion\",\"source_metadata\":null,\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"a128f3f9-2e31-4c1b-9b7a-9392d8cafae9\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"An analyst uses the following principle in a solution. Identify its most specific subtopic: The coefficient of range is a relative measure based on the largest and smallest values.\",\"hi\":\"एक विश्लेषक समाधान में निम्न सिद्धांत का उपयोग करता है। इसका सबसे विशिष्ट उपविषय पहचानिए: परास गुणांक सबसे बड़े और सबसे छोटे मान पर आधारित सापेक्ष माप है।\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Mean Deviation\",\"hi\":\"माध्य विचलन\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Quartile Deviation\",\"hi\":\"चतुर्थक विचलन\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Standard Deviation\",\"hi\":\"मानक विचलन\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Measures of Relative Dispersion\",\"hi\":\"सापेक्ष प्रसरण के माप\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified: SSC CGL Statistics — Measures of Relative Dispersion\",\"source_metadata\":null,\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0}],\"hasMore\":true,\"nextCursor\":\"a128f3f9-2e31-4c1b-9b7a-9392d8cafae9\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":300,"tags":["question-batch","question-batch:subtopic:v9:44d22a4c-3f2d-4781-a0cd-2e5c6582645e"]}